WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.390
I was the first spacecraft to visit another planet.

2
00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:12.940
People hoped Venus might be a warm, steamy jungle world.

3
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.890
I measured it and found it scorching hot under its clouds.

4
00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:23.560
On the way, I was the first to feel the wind that blows from the Sun.

5
00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.820
Now I circle the Sun with no one listening.

6
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.660
I was the first to visit another planet.
